  "content": "\n\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join our Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fquillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支援我\"></a></h1>\n<h1>夜視</h1>\n<p>《夜視》是一款輕量級的 Minecraft 資料包，為所有玩家提供<strong>無限夜視效果</strong>，非常適合探索黑暗的洞穴與建築，完全無需依賴火把。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>強烈建議僅用於單人遊戲模式</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>效果靜默生效（無旋轉粒子特效）。</li>\n<li>完全相容<strong>Minecraft 1.20.5+</strong>。</li>\n<li>即插即用 &mdash; 無需任何設定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1294716/description_e7199d76-06d1-4492-aeab-06156c309240.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1294716/description_b57d75be-5f97-45fe-8598-81a6537e7099.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
